  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Anti-Aging</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Uneven Texture</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ allure 2021 Best of Beauty Award Winner</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A clean, award-winning, multipurpose cream highlighter that gives skin a luminous glow in three universal shades.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Radiant </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation: </strong>Cream </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Hyaluronic Acid: Boosts moisture.</p><p>- Jojoba Seed Oil: Improves hydration and strengthens skin’s moisture barrier.</p><p>- Caper Extract: Helps soothe, calm, and reduce the appearance of redness.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is gluten-free and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>How to Use: <br></b><br>Gucci Westman's Tip -  Use the edge of the Westman Atelier Blender Brush to find your cheekbone and follow upwards, let the brush envelop your cheek.  \n<br>\n<br>• For  Cheeks: Apply with Westman Atelier Blender Brush or the flat side of fingers for a smooth and refined application.\n<br>• For Eyes: Use the edge of the brush or your finger to swipe luminous color across eye lids. \n<br>•Includes linen pouch</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>-Hyaluronic Acid: Boosts moisture.</p><p>-Jojoba Seed Oil: Improves hydration and strengthens skin’s moisture barrier.</p><p>-Caper Extract: Helps soothe, calm, and reduce the appearance of redness.</p><p><br></p><p>Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Octyldodecanol, Mica, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojaba) Seed Oil, Silica, Beeswax [Cera Alba], Helianthus Annuus, (Sunflower) Seed Wax [Helianthus Annuus Seed Wax], Flavor (Aroma), Octyldodecyl Myristate, Capparis Spinosa Fruit Extract, Ethylhexyl, Palmitate, Dimethylmethoxy Chromanol, Trihydroxystearin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Titanium Dioxide CI 77891, Iron Oxides CI 77491\t\n</p><p><br><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Anti-Aging</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Uneven Texture</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ allure 2021 Best of Beauty Award Winner</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A clean, award-winning, multipurpose cream highlighter that gives skin a luminous glow in three universal shades.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Radiant </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation: </strong>Cream </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Hyaluronic Acid: Boosts moisture.</p><p>- Jojoba Seed Oil: Improves hydration and strengthens skin’s moisture barrier.</p><p>- Caper Extract: Helps soothe, calm, and reduce the appearance of redness.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is gluten-free and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0